UnitVotingEscrow::GrantRole
├── when the caller is not the vpm role admin
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when granting the vpm role to a valid candidate
│   └── it should grant the vpm role to the candidate
├── when granting a non vpm role to a valid candidate
│   └── it should grant the non vpm role to the candidate
└── when the candidate already holds the vpm role
    └── it should keep the vpm role on the holder
